# The dataset is byte-pinned: pspine.data verifies a SHA-256 on every load.
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites LF as CRLF and every clone fails
# the hash -- which is exactly what CI caught. Data files are never text-normalised.
pspine/_datasets/** -text -eol
*.csv -text
# Everything else may be normalised normally.
* text=auto
